WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.859
Did you know that some races in One Piece
have natural elemental abilities like fire,

00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:06.410
water, and electricity?

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:10.830
Or that Buggy the Clown might be related to
a tribe of cannibals?

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:16.859
And I bet you never knew that the Yonko Kaido,
this venomous jailer, and this evil pirate

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:22.710
might actually all be a part of a secret ancient
race that has been hiding for HUNDREDS of

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.710
chapters.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:29.939
So let’s explain every secret, history,
and crazy special abilities for every single

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:31.130
race in One Piece.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:37.719
Of course starting with the massive men and
women of the giant race, whose culture is

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:39.020
based on Norse mythology.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:43.880
Now obviously we know that giants are literally
the tallest people in the world.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:50.660
In fact, THE SMALLEST giant is an absurd twelve
meters tall, which is like stacking about

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.410
seven average people on top of each other.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.690
And that is just the smallest one.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:01:01.310
Yeah, this race is MASSIVE with some of the
tallest giants reaching heights of over 20

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.310
meters tall.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:08.920
And with incredible size comes insane natural
power and we have even been told that on average

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:14.439
giants are the strongest fighters in the world,
which just makes a lot of sense.

00:01:14.439 --> 00:01:19.509
I mean would you want this massive ax or sword
coming down on you?

00:01:19.509 --> 00:01:23.659
One thing you may not know though is that
while the giant’s most well known island

00:01:23.659 --> 00:01:28.530
is Elbaf, there are actually giants who come
from all over the world.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:33.369
Which leads us to the most mysterious thing
about the giants is that there appear to be

00:01:33.369 --> 00:01:38.030
secret groups among the giants that have even
more special abilities.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:45.110
For example, these snowy giants that we met
in Punk Hazard are TWICE as tall as normal

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:47.460
giants and are covered with fur.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:52.740
There are also Giant and Fishmen hybrids,
which don’t even ask me how that happened,

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:58.330
but these people are called Wotans just like
this guy who we met during the Long-Ring Long

00:01:58.330 --> 00:01:59.330
Land arc.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:05.670
Then of course the most powerful giants are
the Ancient Giants, also sometimes called

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:06.670
Demon giants.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:10.260
And these guys take it to a whole new level.

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.990
The only two confirmed members of the Ancient
giants.

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:17.970
The first is Oars, who lived centuries ago
and was called a Continent Puller, and the

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:24.280
second is his descendant, Little Oars Jr.
who helped free Ace during the battle at Marineford.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:31.040
On top of their extra size and strength, these
two seem like more beast than person with

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:36.390
their horns and sharp fangs, but the next
race in one piece is even more furry.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:42.080
That’s because the Minks are a tribe of
human-like animals who live on the back of

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.519
this massive elephant.

00:02:43.519 --> 00:02:48.660
Now what might surprise you is that there
is a very clear split on what the Minks look

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.800
like depending on their gender.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:55.550
For example, the males are basically full
on animals who just walk on two legs, while

00:02:55.550 --> 00:03:01.010
the females tend to look more human with some
added animal features like fur and animal

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:05.420
ears.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:11.890
But despite some of their cute appearances,
this race is extremely powerful for two main

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:12.890
reasons.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:17.790
First, they are one of ONLY THREE RACES in
the one piece world who can naturally control

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:19.209
an elemental ability.

00:03:19.209 --> 00:03:24.890
And we’ll talk about the other two in just
a minute, but the Minks can use Electro, which

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.670
adds electricity to their attacks.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:32.280
Which is stupidly powerful if you ask me.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:35.950
But their Sulong transformation.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:44.189
And wow, this is both beautiful AND terrifying
because when a mink looks at a full moon,

00:03:44.189 --> 00:03:49.030
their fur turns completely white and they
gain unbelievable boosts in speed, powers,

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.030
and endurance.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:54.450
There is a downside though because if a Mink
doesn't learn how to control the power and

00:03:54.450 --> 00:04:00.269
turn back to normal they can literally kill
themselves by going berserk for too long.

00:04:00.269 --> 00:04:06.079
And like most non-human races, they have a
pretty dark history, because at one point

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:10.590
they had to flee to the back of this giant
elephant.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:15.970
Which if you ask me, it was probably to escape
being wiped out by our next race.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:23.290
That’s because there is no race as destructive
as humans.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:33.300
Now of course there is a huge variety of humans,
from the pretty average weak human all the

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:38.840
way up to the monstrously powerful ones like
Big Mom who can wipe out an entire tribe of

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.620
giants all on her own.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:45.490
But despite their individual powers, we already
know that humans didn’t always rule the

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.490
world.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:51.050
In fact, some of the other overpowered races
we will talk about in just a few minutes were

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:56.430
once considered gods, but humans were likely
able to conquer the world thanks to their

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:59.320
advanced technology and scientific advancements.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:04.830
However, you probably didn’t ever realize
that there are many unique groups of humans

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.460
scattered around the world.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:11.400
Of course, there is the Kuja tribe, who are
the warrior women of Amazon Lily who seem

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:14.120
to have a natural ability to use haki.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.090
Plus they somehow only give birth to women.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:21.090
So no men for this tribe, unless you are Luffy
of course.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:26.000
There are also tons of humans who have super
strange appearances, such as the chestnut

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:31.620
on top of this guy’s head, the round, squishy
noses of the cannibalistic Kumate tribe who

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.850
might actually be relatives of Buggy.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:39.770
There are also ape humans and the horned humans
like the Emperor Kaido, this mad scientist,

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:44.250
the warden of Impel Down Magellan, and this
member of Blackbeard’s crew.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:49.810
Because even though their horns all look a
bit different, they could all actually be

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:54.460
the descendants of ancient giants, who also
had these massive horns.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:06:00.280
Seriously, I just need to know if these are
just random design choices by the author or

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:07.400
if there actually some giant ancestry tree
that explains all of these interesting features.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:13.370
Now, while there are so many mysteries surrounding
humans, one of the MOST MISUNDERSTOOD races

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:16.160
are the fishmen and merfolk.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.940
That’s because these are actually TWO.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.940
SEPARATE.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:20.940
RACES.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:26.410
And obviously, Oda took inspiration from the
mermaid myths in our world to create his merfolk,

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:31.910
you may not have realized that he basically
reversed this idea to come up with the fishmen.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:38.580
So merfolk have a fish lower body and human
upper body, while fishmen who have a human

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.750
lower body and fish-like features on their
upper bodies.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:47.240
But even with these differences they can both
live in the sea and can have kids together.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.380
So let’s break down the differences a bit
more.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:56.050
Because the actual fish-men all have gills
and lungs which means they can live on both

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:57.690
land and sea.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:03.180
Fishmen are also naturally ten times stronger
than the average human, and on top of that,

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:08.360
they usually have some special characteristics
based on what type of fish they are.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:14.430
Take Arlong, for example, who is a sawshark
fishman, and one of his special abilities

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:21.379
is that he can regrow his teeth immediately,
kinda like how a shark has many rows of teeth.

00:07:21.379 --> 00:07:27.780
Or take this octopus fishman, who can squirt
ink just like an actual octopus.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:32.650
But most importantly is that the fishmen are
the second major group with the ability to

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:38.090
control an element because with their Fishman
Karate they can manipulate water into bullets,

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:41.650
slashes, spears, and much, much more.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:47.500
Seriously, this might be the most underused
OP ability in the story…

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.889
But moving on.

00:07:48.889 --> 00:07:54.780
Now, all of this is separate from merfolk,
which includes mermaids and mermen who are

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.930
naturally born with a fish-like tail.

00:07:56.930 --> 00:08:01.380
Now, the men will ALWAYS have this tail, but
luckily the women can choose to split their

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:06.050
tail once they turn thirty, so they can walk
around on two legs.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:10.580
And while they don’t have as many special
abilities as the fish-men, they are officially

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:16.129
the fastest swimmers in the ocean AND they
can communicate with other fish in the sea.

00:08:16.129 --> 00:08:21.860
Next we’re gonna get a little weird because
even though they are different races, the

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:27.479
merfolk and fishmen can have kids together,
and this can produce an child that is either

00:08:27.479 --> 00:08:29.180
merfolk or fish-men.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:34.529
However, even that can’t compare in weirdness
to this next race, or I guess races, as we

00:08:34.529 --> 00:08:35.529
discuss the long…

00:08:35.529 --> 00:08:37.140
uhh, body parts tribes.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:42.740
And I’m of course talking about the Long-Arm,
Long-Leg, and Snakeneck races.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:49.040
Which are basically all just like they sound,
and are surprisingly based on ancient Japanese

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.040
creatures.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.920
The Long-legs tribe have extra long legs,
like Big Mom’s daughters here.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:58.560
The Snakenecks have freakishly long necks,
but the long arm tribe take it one step further

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:05.060
because they have an entire extra elbow in
each of their arms, which means they can bend

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.600
their arms in unnatural directions.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:12.740
The most famous of these is the musical pirate
Scratchman Apoo.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:17.630
But there’s one thing I bet you didn’t
know because while these three groups don’t

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:23.520
play an important role in the story, the Long
Arm and Long Leg tribes have been fighting

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:28.220
a war that goes back all the past to the Void
Century.

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:33.070
Which is just kinda crazy to think that they’ve
been fighting for longer than the World Government

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.070
has been in power.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:35.070
Now we’re not quite done with longish body
parts yet, because next we have Luffy’s

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:36.070
stretchy thing.

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.070
Wait, wait, hold on.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.070
That wasn’t supposed to be in here.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.070
Just forget about that and subscribe to the
channel for more one piece content just like

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:40.070
this.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.070
Anyway, there is actually one more strange
group of people with extra long heads.

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.420
And while we don’t officially have a name
for them, we’ll just call them the Long

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:46.920
Head People, who have a surprising number
of named characters.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:52.620
For example, there is this marine Vice-admiral,
this scientist who sent automata to the moon,

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:57.180
this pointy headed pirate, and this ninja
leader.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:01.649
What you won’t believe though is that the
Sky People are one of the most interesting

00:10:01.649 --> 00:10:05.740
groups in the entire story, and are clearly
based on angles.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:11.540
As we know from the Skypiea arc, there are
three separate groups of Sky People, although

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.420
they might have once been all the same.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:19.680
They are the Skypieans, the Shandorans, and
the Birkans, who all have differently shaped

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.930
wings and share a common background.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:27.430
You see, during Enel’s cover story, we learned
that the winged people once lived on the moon

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.810
and that they eventually had to float down
to the planet because of a lack of resources.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:36.649
The Birkan and Skypiens settled on the clouds
and the Shandorans settled on the island of

00:10:36.649 --> 00:10:38.450
Jaya down on the sea.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:43.240
And while we don’t know a ton more about
their ancient histories, we do know that the

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:47.870
Shandian people were once friends with the
Ancient Kingdom and were even trusted with

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.340
a Poneglyph.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:53.510
Honestly though, all three groups of sky people
don’t have any special abilities.

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:58.220
They can’t even fly with their wings, which
is a major disappointment.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:03.970
Although they do make good use of the natural
resources located in the sky such as the dials

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.160
and seastone.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:12.230
But speaking of special abilities, the one
race with the most OP ability in the story

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:18.630
is the Three-Eyed tribe, which may have been
inspired by ancient Hindu and Tao beliefs.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:23.779
Now, just like another extremely important
tribe we will discuss in a moment, we only

00:11:23.779 --> 00:11:26.959
know one confirmed member of the three eyed
tribe.

00:11:26.959 --> 00:11:34.310
That is of course Big Mom’s daughter, Pudding,
who is a half-blood member of the mysterious

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.310
tribe.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:39.420
Which I guess means there has to be at least
one more out there somewhere, her father or

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.420
something.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:45.680
Unfortunately though, we don’t know about
them except they have the insane ability to

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.380
awaken the Voice of All Things.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:52.930
Which if you don’t remember, this ability
allows anyone to essentially understand the

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:58.560
basics of any spoken or written communication,
like when Luffy could vaguely understand what

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:01.480
was being said by these massive Sea Kings.

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:07.399
And because this is such an important ability,
I certainly believe that Pudding or another

00:12:07.399 --> 00:12:12.250
member of her tribe will play a massive role
in the story later on.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:17.089
Now from one of the most important races,
let’s shift to what is honestly one of my

00:12:17.089 --> 00:12:23.470
favorite races in One Piece, the Dwarves,
who are based on real world Scandinavian myths.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:29.860
And man, these tiny creatures are simply incredible
because despite their size they are actually

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:37.100
EXTREMELY POWERFUL, with an average dwarf
being able to easily destroy an entire building.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:42.029
Plus with their small size they are experts
at sneaking around and remaining unseen, and

00:12:42.029 --> 00:12:45.430
they are incredibly talented at growing natural
things.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:50.660
However, despite all the positives, the dwarves,
or more specifically the dwarves we met in

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:54.200
Dressrosa have an extremely dark past.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:13:01.410
Because just like many other races, they were
forced into slavery for hundreds of years.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:05.610
Luckily they were freed, but still, if we’ve
learned anything so far, it’s that humans

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.519
can be pretty awful.

00:13:08.519 --> 00:13:14.100
What you may not know though is that there
may be an entirely separate tribe of dwarves

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:21.240
because back in Big Mom’s library we saw
this tiny creature pinned in a book.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:26.350
This is a Kinokobito, and while we don’t
know anything else about it, its small size

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.720
may mean it is related to the dwarves.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:33.889
And there is also a pun here in the Japanese
name because Kinoko translates to mushroom

00:13:33.889 --> 00:13:38.740
while Bito means human, so the name literally
means Mushroom Human.

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:44.180
Now, prepare yourselves for this next race
because they are probably the most individually

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:46.839
powerful in the entire world.

00:13:46.839 --> 00:13:51.891
I am talking about the Lunarian tribe, who
we were first introduced to during the final

00:13:51.891 --> 00:13:53.500
battle in Wano.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:58.459
And this tribe has a lot of symbolism relating
to the moon.

00:13:58.459 --> 00:14:03.899
I mean their name literally mean Moon people,
but they are also associated with highest

00:14:03.899 --> 00:14:06.709
ranking Christian angles mentioned in the
bible.

00:14:06.709 --> 00:14:13.540
While little is known about the tribe, we
met the only known survivor during the Wano

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.540
arc.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:21.130
And as you can see they have a unique appearance,
with stunning white hair, enormous black wings,

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.430
and brown skin.

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:26.880
Plus you might have noticed he has literal
flames burning on his back.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.880
Yup, that’s right.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.259
They can control fire.

00:14:30.259 --> 00:14:35.269
But what’s extra special about these flames
on his back is that when it is burning his

00:14:35.269 --> 00:14:40.500
durability shoots way up so that even Zoro
cannot damage him at all.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:46.420
However, for some reason when these flames
go out, he gets a speed boost, but his durability

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.750
drops so much that Zoro was able to defeat
him.

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:54.769
Beyond that, this Lunarian can also create
flaming blasts and even this fire dragon.

00:14:54.769 --> 00:14:59.370
But that’s not even the most important thing
about the Lunarians because they used to be

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:04.790
considered a tribe of gods who lived on top
of the Red line.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:09.829
Somehow though the tribe was nearly wiped
out, and I can pretty much guarantee that

00:15:09.829 --> 00:15:14.829
it was because of the World Government who
tried to wipe them out after they took control

00:15:14.829 --> 00:15:17.940
during the void century.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:27.000
What’s even more SHOCKING though is the
INSANE idea that demons might actually exist

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.190
in One Piece.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.190
Hear me out.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:32.750
Have you ever wondered why devil fruits are
called what they are?

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:37.040
Well, wouldn’t it make sense if there was
once an actual devil or some other monster

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.000
that these fruits were named after?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:43.900
And with recent reveals in the manga, we have
even more evidence that someone like the world

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:49.279
government’s secret ruler, Imu, and the
Gorosei might actually be immortal devils

00:15:49.279 --> 00:15:51.949
who have lived ever since the void century.

00:15:51.949 --> 00:15:57.459
Which would definitely explain how they’ve
been able to rule the world for so long.

00:15:57.459 --> 00:16:03.190
But while this isn’t confirmed, another
secret race was just revealed in the manga

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:07.959
with the introduction of a group called the
Buccaneers, who in real life were pirates

00:16:07.959 --> 00:16:09.949
that mostly sailed in the Caribbean.

00:16:09.949 --> 00:16:15.139
Apparently, these people are a hybrid race
between humans and giants, which gives them

00:16:15.139 --> 00:16:20.380
impressive size and strength, but in addition
to that they are one of the only known groups

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:25.130
of people who know about the history of the
legendary figure, Nika.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:30.240
Of course, this is the name of Luffy’s devil
fruit, but it was also a historical person

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.790
from the distant past.

